  "invariants": [
    "Provider-owned query and authenticated readback are the only lookup input. Service selects repository/run/artifacts from immutable original job mapping PLUS separately service-recorded protected dispatch identity, never signed report fields.",
    "Do not repurpose the CI read-only source App as production Actions authority. No production credential or dispatch policy is configured here. Use the existing central App abstraction only under separately approved owner policy.",
    "Qualification ZIP has exactly manifest.json and measurements.json; companion has exactly acquisition.json and request-context.json. Canonical member bytes, signatures, original binary hashes and observed selected closed metadata must independently agree.",
    "Every measured group binds the same original context and exact acquired manifest/archive; core-only lifecycle cannot qualify ACF, and creation ID0 is unsupported. Actual independently acquired Child renderer/source bytes are required; hash inventory does not supply source bytes.",
    "Full snapshots/record/meta hashes are measured independently at all stages. Original full snapshot equals the capture; candidate semantic digest equals the immutable reviewed candidate, and restored semantic digest equals the original semantic preimage. WordPress timestamps and native ACF storage legitimately change raw record/meta hashes; they are retained as observed evidence, not silently replaced or required equal to a preview precondition. Untouched post/meta, unrelated fields/rows/layouts and raw core/ACF restore relations are exact. The semantic projection excludes only post_id, unrelated_meta_sha256 and post_record_sha256, matching the existing native adapter.",
    "All timing observations share original protected request and original intent expiry. Expiry is rechecked after parsing and under final CAS; acquisition total60s/overall90s monotonic deadlines cannot restart on retry, callbacks or recovery.",
    "Original production/MCP/default limits and existing access-veto2.5s path are unchanged. This separate bounded source interface remains unregistered and non-admitting pending independent authenticated acquisition and retention/readback proof."
  ]
}
